{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/626312-open-development-where-is-it-at-right-now-and-what-do-you-want-to-see-soon","id":626312,"title":"Open Development: Where is it at right now? And what do you want to see soon?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-13T22:00:01-07:00","id":626312,"title":"Open Development: Where is it at right now? And what do you want to see soon?","content":"We've seen the new Court System, the 1/3rd of Kiths, the Seemings, and a freehold document so far (I'm probably missing something as well), but there's a fair amount of content still that would be good to hear an update about (The other Contracts, 2/3rds of Kiths, Oneriomancy, Merits, what the Hedge is... amongst a lot of other things). What do you guys want to see soon? And what do you guys want to hear an update on? I haven't seen an update for a bit, so my thoughts wander to when we might see more.<br /> <br /> Personally, the above, are things I want to hear about... I'd probably put it in the order of Contracts, Kiths, Hedge as the ones I'm most looking forward to (And it's a tight race).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":287,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/287-wildfire","user":"Wildfire","date":". 08-14-2015, 01:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/287-wildfire","name":"Wildfire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T22:44:21-07:00","id":626350,"title":"","content":"Tell us what the hell a Hunstman is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"rea