om/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-27T20:22:46-08:00","id":793919,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/626312-open-development-where-is-it-at-right-now-and-what-do-you-want-to-see-soon?p=631822#post631822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I'm going to touch on mental illness, and I most certainly am because it's important to me, the least I can do is give it the respect of specificity. It's never a punishment. It's never a consequence of being a &quot;bad person&quot;. It's why I fought tooth and nail to get &quot;Derangements&quot; removed from the Storytelling System.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thankyou so much for your efforts on this. So many of the members of my gaming group deal with mental health concerns and I deal with a learning disability myself. It's so good to see these things considered and treated respectfully in a game and fandom that we enjoy so much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6748-michael-kenner","name":"Michael Kenner","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6748_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-29T21:51:06-08:00","id":795379,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael Kenner</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/626312-open-development-where-is-it-at-right-now-and-what-do-you-want-to-see-soon?p=793919#post793919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thankyou so much for your efforts on this. So many of the members of my gaming group deal with mental health concerns and I deal with a learning disability myself. It's so good to see these things considered and treated respectfully in a game and fandom that we enjoy so much.</div> </div> </div> </div>Agreed. While I'm fine with mental issues being represented mechanically, they do need to also be represented accurately and respectfully.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}